OL,3,GNEWSAMovember maypole dancing for men's
OL,4,Ahealth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village swapped its traditional
OL,7,Fmaypole dancers for a troupe of men who
OL,8,Fperformed a specially choreographed
OL,9,Froutine to raise awareness of men's
OL,10,Fhealth and thousands of pounds for
OL,11,FMovember.
OL,13,FTheir dance took place in Offenham,
OL,14,FWorcestershire, on Sunday to "get more
OL,15,Fmen talking about men's health",
OL,16,Forganisers said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
