OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMovember maypole dancing for men's
OL,4,Ahealth
OL,5,
OL,6,FKelly Jordan, who had the idea for Mo
OL,7,FAround the Maypole in the summer, said
OL,8,Fwomen and children had usually danced
OL,9,Fwith ribbons around the 64ft (19.5m)
OL,10,Fpole which was at the centre of village
OL,11,Flife.
OL,13,F"The maypole was simply the vehicle to
OL,14,Fstart those conversations," she said,
OL,15,Fadding the event saw an "incredible
OL,16,Fturnout" despite the rain, and so far
OL,17,Fhas raised more than #6,300.
